<title>UK: Vanguard Medica H1 pretax loss 3.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Medica H1 pretax loss 3.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.0 loss	    vs 21.0 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.7  loss	    vs 1.8  loss</p>
<p> Operating result	 4.5  loss	    vs 2.0  loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Vanguard Medica is a biopharmaceutical company which has a number of drugs under development, including products for migraine and psoriasis. It has no products on the market and does not pay a dividend.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
